    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748630/extras/de7ff0cd8d1856220e872e3b4b0bb5c7.avif?t=1707995806\" width=615 height=150 /></span> <br><strong>Embark on a journey through a sprawling mansion, rich in secrets, hidden passages, and eerie manifestations, as you untangle the enigmatic web that shrouds its history.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748630/extras/ae85e81abd259b026834d6443f33f2a8.avif?t=1707995806\" width=615 height=100 /></span><br><strong>Engage your intellect with unique puzzles, utilizing a dimensional camera to reveal unseen dimensions, unlocking new paths, and peeling back the layers of the mansion's secrets.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748630/extras/f3f727234563913cb208e9d1427e4e74.poster.avif?t=1707995806\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748630/extras/f3f727234563913cb208e9d1427e4e74.webm?t=1707995806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748630/extras/f3f727234563913cb208e9d1427e4e74.mp4?t=1707995806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748630/extras/8786aa6b92c59b0ad2bb310420b04af1.avif?t=1707995806\" width=615 height=100 /></span><br><strong>Navigate through chilling situations, coming face-to-face with otherworldly entities that blur the lines between reality and nightmare, intensifying the suspense and horror.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c